// Vex — the deck tough. "Settle it" launches a real turn-based battle and, on
// the player's win, despawns him for good (recorded in DefeatedNpcs).

title: greet
---
// Blade out for the whole confrontation: a looping gesture holds until the
// conversation closes (or the fight starts).
<<play_anim Sword_Idle loop>>
$npc: This is my stretch of deck, groundsider. Turn around, or we settle it right here.
-> Settle it
    <<start_battle despawn>>
    <<stop>>
-> Walk away
    $npc: Smart. Keep walking.
===
